<title>USA: Vulcan Materials names James chairman.</title>
<headline>Vulcan Materials names James chairman.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vulcan Materials Co said Friday it had named Donald James chairman to succeed Herb Sklenar, who retired as chairman of the board.</p>
<p>James, who has been president and chief executive since February of this year, will continue as chief executive, the company said.</p>
